# jaxfne Super-Skills (Cursor)

Route work through approved skills. Full SKILL.md bodies live in the developer's user-level agent skill install — not copied into this repo. Registry: `internal_docs/skills/README.md`.

## Doctrine (non-negotiable)

- Canonical import: `import jaxfne as jtfne`
- Package-native engine: tutorials configure; `jaxfne` computes — no notebook-local solvers, readouts, or optimizers
- Proxy readout language: LFP/CSD/EEG/MEG/EMM are proxies unless solver + calibration evidence exists
- Lazy optional deps: `optax`, `jaxley`, CUDA — guarded imports; CPU import must succeed
- Default gates: `truth_safe_unverified`, `computational_scaffold`, `laminar_proxy_no_pde`, `physical_amplitude_claim_allowed=False`
- No calibrated EEG/MEG/PDE/mechanism claims without validation evidence

See `internal_docs/loop_context/04_TRUTH_GATES_AND_CLAIMS.md`.

